---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
---

<Card
  colSpan="md:col-span-1"
  rowSpan="md:row-span-8 lg:row-span-6"
  title="About me"
  customClass="overflow-y-auto"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      I'm a full-stack developer based in Copenhagen who enjoys building
      things end to end — from the interface people see to the APIs and
      infrastructure behind it.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      Day to day that means Laravel &amp; Filament, TypeScript &amp; React,
      WordPress &amp; WooCommerce, and MySQL &amp; PostgreSQL — though I'll
      always pick the best tool for the job, even when it's not on my usual
      list.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      Beyond coding, I'm passionate about traveling and exploring new places.
      An unusual hobby of mine is flying planes. It's a thrilling way to see
      the world from a different perspective.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
